stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Breaks Counted or Isolation
    lg1: Breaks AcceptedCounts or CanClose in some cases
    lg2: Path to the AcceptedCounts or CanClose or Counted or Isolation bug
  }
  class lg0 breaks
  class lg1 mayBreak
  class lg2 bugPath
  s0: MP-1001: not started | MP-1002: not started
  s1: MP-1001: not started | MP-1002: worker started
  s2: MP-1001: changed, check missing | MP-1002: not started
  s3: MP-1001: not started | MP-1002: worker editing
  s4: MP-1001: checked, car not landed | MP-1002: not started
  s5: MP-1001: work done, book shows no change | MP-1002: not started#59; new session
  s6: MP-1001: not started | MP-1002: checked, book asks for the check
  s7: MP-1001: checked, book asks for the check | MP-1002: changed, check missing
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: MP-1002: you start its worker
  s0 --> s2: MP-1001: you change its code yourself
  s1 --> s3: MP-1002: its worker edits in its worktree
  s2 --> s4: MP-1001: you run its anchor: it passes
  s2 --> s5: MP-1001: you hand off to a new session
  s3 --> s6: MP-1002's worker returns, its check passed: the book does not count it
  s4 --> s5: MP-1001: you hand off to a new session
  s4 --> s7: MP-1002: you change its code yourself
  s5 --> s5: MP-1001: you declare its verify with its task
